    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kölö ne tötomönye kareranyi wölnö le mïröt, airökwï ngwïny? Nyo kötösïwïyinyi kutïngkotï akïpotonchö ompö nyökoryö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kötöpotonchot le pögh cho kutu ompö nökögh. Nyonö, ateporchinö punköku owesyengu, ategha pipö punton kïpotoncheghö tawungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi ato kingwïnanyi, aigh tïkwïn cho pö otyogh cho melö kikikönecha. Kisïwinyi kutïngkotï akïpotonchö ompö nyökoryö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Kr 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Möminye chi nyo le ompö akonga nyo kikïsïwa anta lïm Tororöt nyo kikongityot nko nyi, nyo ighchini tïkwïn cho pö töngönchin pich cho köninyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itokenyi pich cho ngöreksot otini ighöy tïkwïn cho pö man, chane cho nonöy wölo imöktonyi chane kïtïpisot. Kinarekanyi ompö acha, wölo kikiletacha tagh kegh ngokï, kïrkegh kinarekanyi lö ne, wölo kikïtasacha tagh kegh tïkwïn cho ghach. Kïngeta otini le awïyay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïchicha löwïr mwokïyis, kïrkegh keghacha tïkwïn cho kakïsïwïyi lö karamach, ki ghach tïkwïl! Kïlatecha sökö cho silonchot akïkutïta yomat akwompö ngokicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akï möminye chi nyo wöghöko akïsaghinyi. Möminye chi nyo ngwïnöy wölo imitenyi atökengarak. Anyï ye kewïngenyi kegh wölo kïmitecha, aipakadecha akwompö ngokicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ichinyi paponcha, we ECHOTYON. Kïlatecha mönö ilatenyi ighinto tören. Kighechanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïlenyona mesïwa nyo gha ompö acha anta irwokwecha ompö ngokicho kokay. Kïchicha piköku, syonchecha wey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalïkwï surkwen kanastineku cho tïlilöch, kalïkwï Sayon* surkwen kïlïkwï Yerusalem kïratyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikuwur ma kongu nyo tïlil, wölo kisogho akïsöleninyi papotïnecha. Kikïlïkwï kïratis wölo kikïchömecha löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato kikwitïta atoni ye, o ECHOTYON, tesisenyi? Möminye kïgh nyo ighenyi, isisenyi pat, aipïstecha kewongunö kïtïl owesyencha so?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mungöy ECHOTYON penyï",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
